EMBERTON", "en": "Miss Hart, a word. Last night, someone tried His Lordship's door.", "zh": "哈特小姐，借一步说话。昨天夜里，有人试着开过伯爵的门。"}, {"s": 18.46, "e": 20.13, "who": "IVY", "en": "Someone? Who?", "zh": "有人？是谁？"}, {"s": 20.7, "e": 25.95, "who": "PEMBERTON", "en": "I couldn't say. But whoever it was, they were looking for something.", "zh": "这我说不好。但不管是谁，他是在找东西。"}], "look": "D2"}, "e4_night0": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "That night", "title_zh": "当晚", "next": "e4_scratch", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/6876a49c0f674577baceb987b5950562/e4_night0.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [], "look": null, "cards": [{"at": 0.3, "dur": 2.6, "k_en": "", "k_zh": "", "t_en": "That night", "t_zh": "当晚"}]}, "e4_scratch": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "He heard it", "title_zh": "他听见了", "next": null, "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/3fac036e0aaa4e84a869baf1f0f33645/e4_scratch.mp4"}, "idle": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/4db07b3b62704220b252f6f18f96b75e/e4_scratch.mp4", "captions": [{"s": 7.28, "e": 9.33, "who": "IVY", "en": "What is it? You heard that too?", "zh": "怎么了？你也听见了？"}], "look": "NIGHT", "qte": {"kind": "tap", "icon": "🚪", "en": "Follow him", "zh": "跟上他", "prompt_en": "Earl Grey wants to go out", "prompt_zh": "伯爵想出去", "hint_en": "Tap to open the door and follow him", "hint_zh": "点击开门，跟上伯爵", "goto": "e4_corridor", "timeout": "e4_corridor", "seconds": null, "danger": false, "ok": {}, "lead": 3.0}}, "e4_corridor": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "Light under the door", "title_zh": "门缝里的光", "next": null, "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/cad63784f76b4075b7c9594a951a588b/e4_corridor.mp4"}, "idle": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/d03ddc02611c4f709e4a7fbe2b587749/e4_corridor.mp4", "captions": [{"s": 9.46, "e": 12.07, "who": "IVY", "en": "That's Madam's study. No one goes in there.", "zh": "那是夫人的书房。没人会进去的。"}], "look": "NIGHT", "choice": {"kicker_en": "YOUR CHOICE", "kicker_zh": "你的选择", "q_en": "Someone is in the study. What do you do?", "q_zh": "书房里有人，你要？", "lead": 0.3, "options": [{"en": "Walk right in", "zh": "直接推门进去", "goto": "e4_in", "effects": {"earl": 1, "family": -3}, "premium": false}, {"en": "Watch through the gap", "zh": "从门缝里偷看", "goto": "e4_peek", "effects": {"family": 2}, "premium": false}]}}, "e4_in": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "Caught", "title_zh": "撞个正着", "next": "e4_found0", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/cf0bd992806e430993d8a0e274360ecb/e4_in.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 8.95, "e": 11.74, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "Miss Hart. Late hours, for a cat-sitter.", "zh": "哈特小姐。看猫的，睡得可真晚。"}, {"s": 12.47, "e": 14.9, "who": "IVY", "en": "And you're in Madam's study at midnight. Looking for something?", "zh": "而你半夜在夫人的书房里。在找东西？"}, {"s": 15.95, "e": 19.94, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "This was my aunt's study. Nothing in this house is your concern.", "zh": "这是我姑妈的书房。这房子里的事，轮不到你过问。"}], "look": "NIGHT"}, "e4_peek": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "Through the gap", "title_zh": "门缝", "next": "e4_found0", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/09811569d78a4bf281ca28e222aa2726/e4_peek.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 9.42, "e": 10.81, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "Where did you put it, Aunt Margaret?", "zh": "你到底把它放哪儿了，玛格丽特姑妈？"}], "look": "NIGHT"}, "e4_found0": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "Into the study", "title_zh": "走进书房", "next": "e4_found", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/47e3fdb58def4ee595e0a0860b3b017b/e4_found0.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [], "look": "NIGHT"}, "e4_found": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "What he was looking for", "title_zh": "他在找的东西", "next": null, "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/8bab6ca8226e4990958da2cae1c9639f/e4_found.mp4"}, "idle": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/28223e2fe8c749dda48f66232349fef4/e4_found.mp4", "captions": [{"s": 15.14, "e": 16.81, "who": "IVY", "en": "Is this what he was looking for?", "zh": "他要找的……就是这个？"}], "look": "NIGHT", "qte": {"kind": "tap", "icon": "✉️", "en": "Open it", "zh": "拆开", "prompt_en": "A letter from Madam", "prompt_zh": "夫人留下的信", "hint_en": "Tap to break the seal", "hint_zh": "点击拆开封蜡", "goto": "e4_letter", "timeout": "e4_letter", "seconds": null, "danger": false, "ok": {}, "lead": 0.3}}, "e4_letter": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "Madam's letter", "title_zh": "夫人的信", "next": "e5_open0", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/0d69918a7bae42369c834ea31067f3a5/e4_letter.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 3.44, "e": 8.15, "who": "IVY", "en": "If you're reading this, he chose you. Don't let them rush him.", "zh": "如果你在读这封信，说明他选了你。别让他们逼他。"}], "look": "NIGHT", "summary": {"note_en": "Madam left one more letter. Edmund was looking for it, and Earl Grey found it first.", "note_zh": "夫人还留下了一封信。埃德蒙在找它，而伯爵先一步找到了。"}}, "e5_open0": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "The next morning", "title_zh": "第二天早上", "next": "e5_tuck", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/ee6a1d577c374cdfb089db20114a6e91/e5_open0.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [], "look": null, "cards": [{"at": 0.3, "dur": 3.2, "k_en": "EPISODE FIVE", "k_zh": "第五集", "t_en": "The Review", "t_zh": "审查"}]}, "e5_tuck": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Our secret", "title_zh": "我们的秘密", "next": "e5_knock", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/d9eab1c21c7d4d9190aab33711502320/e5_tuck.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 10.24, "e": 11.71, "who": "IVY", "en": "Our secret, okay?", "zh": "这是我们的秘密，好吗？"}], "look": "D2"}, "e5_knock": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "A review", "title_zh": "审查", "next": "e5_lib0", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/c67e9a8565f34ee2afe7d49279752a17/e5_knock.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 1.98, "e": 6.27, "who": "PEMBERTON", "en": "Mr. Langley is downstairs, Miss Hart. The family has asked for a review.", "zh": "兰利先生在楼下，哈特小姐。家里人要求做一次审查。"}, {"s": 7.66, "e": 9.17, "who": "IVY", "en": "A review of what?", "zh": "审查什么？"}, {"s": 10.88, "e": 12.35, "who": "PEMBERTON", "en": "Of you, I'm afraid.", "zh": "恐怕是审查您。"}], "look": "D2"}, "e5_lib0": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "The library", "title_zh": "图书室", "next": "e5_review", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/de4554f59e6c4d0bbd288be633f6843f/e5_lib0.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 2.98, "e": 5.95, "who": "MR. LANGLEY", "en": "Miss Hart. Good morning.", "zh": "哈特小姐，早上好。"}], "look": "D2"}, "e5_review": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Eighteen hundred pounds", "title_zh": "一千八百四十镑", "next": "e5_trap", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/58e88f82b96c435daa11ad405f2decc4/e5_review.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 0.0, "e": 4.43, "who": "MR. LANGLEY", "en": "Halloway's. One thousand, eight hundred and forty pounds.", "zh": "霍洛威精品店，一千八百四十镑。"}, {"s": 4.5, "e": 7.15, "who": "VIVIENNE", "en": "On a cat. In one afternoon.", "zh": "花在一只猫身上。一个下午。"}, {"s": 8.6, "e": 12.87, "who": "IVY", "en": "Every item was on Pemberton's list. He won't sleep on acrylic.", "zh": "每一样都在彭伯顿的清单上。他不睡腈纶的。"}], "look": "D2"}, "e5_trap": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Let him choose", "title_zh": "让他自己选", "next": null, "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/8f46610bc6e84613a70d4194d9ccc455/e5_trap.mp4"}, "idle": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/e55a948e8be14a118cd2da22fd1953eb/e5_trap.mp4", "captions": [{"s": 3.26, "e": 6.83, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "Aunt Margaret's will is clear. He picks his keeper.", "zh": "玛格丽特姑妈的遗嘱写得很清楚。照顾他的人，由他自己挑。"}, {"s": 9.32, "e": 10.77, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "So let him pick.", "zh": "那就让他挑。"}], "look": "D2", "choice": {"kicker_en": "YOUR CHOICE", "kicker_zh": "你的选择", "q_en": "Edmund wants Earl Grey to choose, right now. What do you do?", "q_zh": "埃德蒙要伯爵当场选人，你要？", "lead": 3.0, "options": [{"en": "Crouch down and call him", "zh": "蹲下来叫他过来", "goto": "e5_call", "effects": {"family": -1}, "premium": false}, {"en": "Stay still and let him choose", "zh": "站着别动，等他自己选", "goto": "e5_wait", "effects": {"earl": 2}, "premium": false}]}}, "e5_call": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Here, sweetheart", "title_zh": "过来，宝贝", "next": "e5_verdict", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/0b13d599e15d4f1b8d2e85105407d7f9/e5_call.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 0.0, "e": 2.87, "who": "IVY", "en": "Earl Grey. Come here, sweetheart.", "zh": "伯爵，过来，宝贝。"}, {"s": 5.82, "e": 7.93, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "Loyalty has a price, it seems.", "zh": "看来忠心也是有价钱的。"}, {"s": 10.22, "e": 11.49, "who": "IVY", "en": "Show-off.", "zh": "爱显摆。"}], "look": "D2"}, "e5_wait": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Take your time", "title_zh": "慢慢来", "next": "e5_verdict", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/73debab5d2e746a695b9abd9f3b15d92/e5_wait.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 1.08, "e": 2.37, "who": "IVY", "en": "Take your time.", "zh": "慢慢来。"}, {"s": 3.14, "e": 4.65, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "Come on, old boy.", "zh": "来呀，老伙计。"}], "look": "D2"}, "e5_verdict": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "For now", "title_zh": "暂时", "next": "e5_miles", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/d018cdaedf47427c96fa3040d29a6a0d/e5_verdict.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 0.68, "e": 4.87, "who": "MR. LANGLEY", "en": "His Lordship appears to have decided. The review is concluded.", "zh": "伯爵大人看来已经做了决定。审查到此结束。"}, {"s": 7.66, "e": 11.75, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "Aunt Margaret always hid things. They have a way of turning up.", "zh": "玛格丽特姑妈总爱藏东西。那些东西，迟早会冒出来的。"}], "look": "D2"}, "e5_miles": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Miles", "title_zh": "迈尔斯", "next": null, "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/fca5d2f2902a4257ad5a51034abed6c9/e5_miles.mp4"}, "idle": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/832d20e4d9054d5189abe500816e6983/e5_miles.mp4", "captions": [{"s": 5.4, "e": 7.89, "who": "MILES", "en": "Salmon. He actually brought salmon.", "zh": "三文鱼。他居然真带了三文鱼。"}, {"s": 12.16, "e": 15.69, "who": "MILES", "en": "Edmund's not after the cat. He's been in her study every night.", "zh": "埃德蒙要的不是猫。他每天夜里都在姑妈的书房。"}], "look": "D2", "choice": {"kicker_en": "YOUR CHOICE", "kicker_zh": "你的选择", "q_en": "Miles seems to be on your side. Do you tell him about the letter?", "q_zh": "迈尔斯像是站在你这边。要告诉他信的事吗？", "lead": 1.21, "options": [{"en": "Show him the letter", "zh": "把信拿给他看", "goto": "e5_tell", "effects": {"family": 3}, "premium": false}, {"en": "Keep it to yourself", "zh": "先不告诉他", "goto": "e5_keep", "effects": {"earl": 1}, "premium": false}]}}, "e5_tell": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Don't let them rush him", "title_zh": "别让他们逼他", "next": "e5_back", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/1144f847a6f849af95ff79121bec0b8b/e5_tell.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 4.36, "e": 7.41, "who": "MILES", "en": "\"Don't let them rush him.\" She knew this would happen.", "zh": "“别让他们逼他。”她早就料到了。"}, {"s": 11.62, "e": 12.97, "who": "MILES", "en": "Keep it away from Edmund.", "zh": "别让埃德蒙拿到它。"}], "look": "D2"}, "e5_keep": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Door's always open", "title_zh": "随时来找我", "next": "e5_back", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/3358ce5369e94a3d93e60e23e58df28a/e5_keep.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 1.44, "e": 3.95, "who": "IVY", "en": "Thanks, Miles. I'll be careful.", "zh": "谢谢你，迈尔斯。我会小心的。"}, {"s": 6.16, "e": 8.99, "who": "MILES", "en": "Fair enough. Door's always open.", "zh": "行吧。有事随时来找我。"}], "look": "D2"}, "e5_back": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Someone was here", "title_zh": "有人来过", "next": null, "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/c041aaf61634431fb20a5beb5a1482e5/e5_back.mp4"}, "idle": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/cc354a3095404dd29d95325228e29b2f/e5_back.mp4", "captions": [], "look": "D2", "qte": {"kind": "tap", "icon": "✉️", "en": "Check the bag", "zh": "摸摸包", "prompt_en": "Someone searched your room", "prompt_zh": "有人翻过你的房间", "hint_en": "Tap to check the letter is still there", "hint_zh": "点击看看信还在不在", "goto": "e5_end", "timeout": "e5_end", "seconds": null, "danger": false, "ok": {}, "lead": 3.0}}, "e5_end": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Still here", "title_zh": "还在", "next": "ep6", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/aa55e024bb764e1286070fefc9890b53/e5_end.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 6.26, "e": 7.75, "who": "IVY", "en": "They didn't find it.", "zh": "他们没找到。"}, {"s": 7.68, "e": 11.89, "who": "IVY", "en": "But now they know I have something.", "zh": "可现在，他们知道我手里有东西了。"}], "look": "D2", "summary": {"note_en": "Earl Grey chose you in front of everyone. Then someone searched your room. The letter is safe, for now.", "note_zh": "伯爵当着所有人的面选了你。然后，有人翻了你的房间。信还在，暂时。"}}, "ep6": {"ep": 6, "title_en": "Episode 6", "title_zh": "第 6 集", "next": null, "media": {}, "idle": null, "captions": [], "look": null, "end": true, "kicker_en": "Coming soon", "kicker_zh": "敬请期待", "note_en": "Someone in this house wants that letter. Your choices so far will follow you there.", "note_zh": "这座庄园里有人想要那封信。你做过的每个选择，都会跟着你走下去。"}}}